    // --- Help ---
    "ayuda.pagina": "page {} of {}",
    "ayuda.p1.titulo": "HOW TO PLAY",
    "ayuda.p1.cuerpo": "Close off the arena by drawing walls while the balls bounce.\n\n# Drawing a wall\nLEFT click:  draws along the current axis.\nRIGHT click: draws along the opposite axis.\nTAB:         switches the default axis.\n\nA wall grows from BOTH ends at once.\nWhen one half reaches a wall, that half is SEALED:\na ball can no longer break it (solid wall colour).\nOnly the half still growing (warning colour) costs you\na life if a ball reaches it.\n\n# Goal\nClose off the percentage of area the level asks for. Any\nregion left WITHOUT balls is sealed automatically.",
    "ayuda.p2.titulo": "SCORING AND STARS",
    "ayuda.p2.cuerpo": "# Risk and reward\nClosing a large, comfortable area scores FEW points.\nClosing a small area, with balls close by and fast, scores MANY.\nThe score rises with: smaller area, nearer balls and\nhigher speed.\n\n# Combo\nConsecutive completed walls raise the multiplier (x2, x3...\nup to x8). It resets when you lose a life or wait too long\nbetween walls.\n\n# Stars\nEvery Enhanced level has optional goals: lose no lives,\nclose more area than required, finish in time, keep a\ncombo... They award 1 to 3 stars and you can replay levels\nto improve them.",
    "ayuda.p3.titulo": "ENHANCED: OBSTACLES AND BALLS",
    "ayuda.p3.cuerpo": "Enhanced adds elements on top of the SAME base mechanic.\n\n# Obstacles (world 3)\nSolid block:   cannot be crossed or built upon.\n               Balls bounce off it.\nNo-split zone: balls PASS THROUGH it, but your wall cannot\n               grow across it. It does not count towards the\n               area percentage.\nMoving block:  drifts on its own. If it touches a wall under\n               construction it destroys it, but it does NOT\n               cost you a life. Only balls take lives.\n\n# Special balls (world 4)\nNormal:       the classic one.\nFast:         quicker, less time to react.\nErratic:      changes direction without warning.\nSplitter:     splits in two when it breaks a wall.\nHeavy:        large and slow; ignores shields.",
    "ayuda.p4.titulo": "ENHANCED: POWER-UPS AND CONTROLS",
    "ayuda.p4.cuerpo": "# Power-ups (world 5)\nThey appear in the arena from time to time. Pick them up by\nrunning over them and use them with keys 1 to 5.\n\nSlow motion: slows the balls down for a while.\nFreeze:      stops the balls completely.\nDouble wall: the next wall is drawn twice as fast.\nShield:      the next wall survives one impact without\n             breaking (not against a Heavy ball).\nRemove ball: takes one ball out of the arena.\n\n# Controls\nSPACE pause        R restart the level\nF toggle HUD       1-5 use power-ups\nESC pause / back   M back to menu\n\nORIGINAL MODE has none of this: 10 levels, two balls to\nstart with and the classic mechanic, no power-ups or combos.",
}
